  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 6th level, your spirit makes you extremely tough. You can use your reaction to being hit by a melee attack. When you do so, the damage you take from the attack is reduced by 1d10 + your Dexterity modifier + your brawler level. If you reduce the damage to 0, you can make an unarmed strike as part of this reaction against the creature.</p>",
